cf11ffc9c4bc18312a6, https://si.imgix.net/b8064838/uploads/origins/01d0a82c-d9a9-40f8-98b9-66e0d65cbc61?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d35e9dffe7ee1d50f1f3e668308d1218 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b8064838/uploads/origins/01d0a82c-d9a9-40f8-98b9-66e0d65cbc61?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d7cfce7630c5f42ef02d7d3c7f9f2264 3x"}, "body": "It is nice to meet you.\nI am always interested in your illustrations and cartoons.\nI would like to make the following request.\n\nI would like to request \"Mejiro Palmer\" from \"Uma Musume Pretty Derby\".\nShe is standing in front of the viewer, wearing her \"winning uniform\" and holding a Pom Pom Pudding stuffed animal in her arms.\nThe size of the stuffed animal is https://p-bandai.jp/item/item-1000125660/ぐらいでデザインは多少異なってても大丈夫です.\nWe would like her to wear a hair ornament decorated with Pom Pom Pudding with a smiling expression on her face.\nWe will leave the design of the hair ornament to you.\nWe accept both black-and-white and color images, but even in the case of black-and-white, please color the Pom Pom Penguin plushie and the hair ornament.\nWe will leave the background to you. If there is no background, please use a single color as in the previous work by Air Shakur (https://www.pixiv.net/artworks/97473698).\nIf you want to use no background, please use a single color as in the previous drawing of Air Shakur ().\n\nThank you very much for your consideration.", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 150705, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "マイナス6🖼🎮", "screen_name": "minus6", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1921851298011635712/CdXqHfKO.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/280038457/1746114661/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": true, "popular_cre